  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EcoContact Green Justice_Moldova 2021-2026 - New Strategy Green Justice 2021-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Green Justice EcoContact 2021-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EcoContact har ans&#xf6;kt hos Sveriges ambassad om finansiering av 20 440 001 SEK f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &quot;Green Justice 2021-2025&quot; i Moldavien under perioden 2021-2025. 

Projektet Green Justice syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra de r&#xe4;ttsliga och institutionella ramarna f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;styrning och juridik och att uppn&#xe5; ett starkare engagemang och samarbete mellan alla nyckelakt&#xf6;rer inom milj&#xf6;skyddet p&#xe5; nationell och lokal niv&#xe5;. Projektets aktiviteter &#xe4;r utformade f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; detta m&#xe5;l, med h&#xe4;nsyn till EcoContacts erfarenhet, liksom dess institutionella och icke-statliga partner, och genomf&#xf6;randet av en rad studier om de viktigaste tematiska insatsomr&#xe5;dena. Som ett resultat kommer de beh&#xf6;riga statliga och regionala myndigheternas reglerings- och institutionella kapacitet att st&#xe4;rkas och en h&#xf6;gre &#xf6;verensst&#xe4;mmelse med genomf&#xf6;randet och efterlevnaden av milj&#xf6;lagstiftningen uppn&#xe5;s.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EcoContact has applied to Embassy of Sweden for funding of 20 440 001 SEK  to carry out the Project  &quot;Green Justice  2021-2025&quot; in Moldova during the period 2021-2025. 

The Green Justice project is aiming at improving the legal and institutional framework of environmental governance and justice and to achieve stronger involvement and cooperation of all key players in the environmental protection at the national and local levels. The project activities are designed to implement this objective, taking into account the experience of the EcoContact, as well as its institutional and NGO partners, and undertaking a series of studies on the main thematic areas of intervention. As a result, the regulatory and institutional capacity of competent state and regional authorities will be strengthened and a higher compliance with the implementation and enforcement of environmental law achieved.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of Green Justice project is to improve the legal and institutional framework of environmental governance and justice and to achieve stronger involvement and cooperation of all key players at national and local level.</narrative>
  </description>
